\b Question Paper Shuffler\b0\par
\par
This program was made for Jha Classes. It is given to the schools and teachers Jha Classes chooses to give it to, for preparing their own question papers, and is not for sale or for passing on to anyone else.\par
\par
Installing it needs the administrator password that came with this installer. After it is installed, each person who signs in to this computer sets their own password the first time they open it.\par
\par
The question papers you open with it, and the sets it generates, stay on this computer. Nothing is sent anywhere.\par
\par
The program is provided as it is, without any warranty. Always check a generated set and its answer key before it is printed.\par
